    "text": "By Jasper Whitmore ,\n16 hours ago When the holiday season rolls around, many families want to skip the kitchen chaos and enjoy a stress-free meal together. Illinois offers incredible options for Thanksgiving dining that let you savor delicious food without spending hours cooking and cleaning. From elegant buffets to cozy family-style feasts, these restaurants deliver memorable experiences that make every dollar count. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
